# pop'n music 13 Carnival: the four event-phase codes and the EXTRA code, typed in test mode >
# EVENT OPTIONS (games/popn13/unlocks.toml). From a save at phase 0, it leaves one at MAX phase
# with EXTRA released, with a snap of EVENT OPTIONS after each code:
#   hiraku-popn13 --nvram DIR --script oracle/scripts/popn13-phases.his
# The menus open slowly and start on EXIT. EVENT OPTIONS shows no password line: blue right then
# red opens PHASE PASSWORD, blue left then red EXTRA PASSWORD. The wheel: blue 6/4 turn it (0-9,
# A-Z, from 0 for each code), red 5 enters. After the tenth character the game writes the save
# and goes back to EVENT OPTIONS.
